   \begin{align*}
a + \sqrt{ab} + \sqrt[3]{abc}
& = a + \sqrt{a \cdot a} + \sqrt[3]{a \cdot a \cdot \frac{1}{2}} \\
& = a + a + \sqrt[3]{a^2} \\
& = \frac{11 + 3\sqrt{3}}{8} + \frac{11 + 3\sqrt{3}}{8} + \sqrt[3]{\left(\frac{11 + 3\sqrt{3}}{8}\right)^2} \\
& = \frac{11 + 3\sqrt{3}}{4} + \sqrt[3]{\left(\frac{11 + 3\sqrt{3}}{8}\right)^2} \\
& = \sqrt{\frac{(11 + 3\sqrt{3})^2}{64}} + \sqrt{\frac{(11 + 3\sqrt{3})^4}{64 \cdot 256}} \\
& = \sqrt{\frac{121 + 18\cdot 3 + 66\sqrt{3}}{64}} + \sqrt{\frac{(121 + 18 \cdot 3 + 66\sqrt{3})^2}{64^2 \cdot 256}} \\
& = \sqrt{\frac{169 + 174\sqrt{3}}{192}} + \sqrt{\frac{(169 + 174\sqrt{3})^2}{12288}}
   = \sqrt{\frac{169 + 174\sqrt{3}}{8}}.
\end{align*}
   Thus, the maximum value is $\sqrt{\frac{169 + 174\sqrt{3}}{8}}$. </think> <answer> $\sqrt{\frac{169 + 174\sqrt{3}}{8}}$ </answer>

